omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vGDLh9cAIP8Q7kNvwFCYvTJ&_nc_oc=Ado9oS-oYP-PWAc0MZ_SEwZMbDtfiehexb9Mml2Ru9f_Jnec7IFqW2p_tgTbkG78Y-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6szSD4pFs4A_YsgcKjjsPB1vJsvzSv8gn76CzK-ppAGQ&oe=6A0F2334"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JNLnM-fq3w8Q7kNvwFEDBiZ&_nc_oc=AdrN4lkTMaTFgFsvvB9dbrE-2i3qY1A-JT4xGmXKmY3VgCIbal8vxArAnA3fAwdUocw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7dxMYdpWkEHOZIZVrCdeibaecNLqxeDno5tYymibWj4w&oe=6A0F2496"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JuXk85CRCrcQ7kNvwGgkrfe&_nc_oc=AdozxNZG1H_oFpdBaO5DzYDVcMB3hLuy-JFoi8tcpzyw84P889olRZwbLhVEM1uzwLE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4oTYBcSYKzL3FI_0lsqmHgh2wmtGUR3aYliJEu8ueGlA&oe=6A0F0177"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://